<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>衡水 · 一天</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#f4e7e5;
    --paper-deep:#ecd8d5;
    --red:#c8323a;
    --red-soft:rgba(200,50,58,.35);
    --ink:#000;
    --graphite:#3a3a3c;
    --serif:"Noto Serif SC","Source Han Serif SC","Songti SC","STSong","SimSun",serif;
    --sans:"Noto Sans SC","Source Han Sans SC","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei","Heiti SC",sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0;background:var(--paper-deep);color:var(--ink)}
  body{
    font-family:var(--serif);line-height:1.7;
    padding:max(24px,env(safe-area-inset-top)) 16px max(32px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  .sheet{
    max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--paper);
    padding:clamp(20px,4vw,44px);
    border:1px solid var(--red-soft);
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(var(--red-soft) 1px,transparent 1px);
    background-size:100% 34px;
    background-position:0 -1px;
    position:relative;
  }
  /* four locator blocks, as printed on machine-read answer sheets */
  .sheet::before,.sheet::after,.foot::before,.foot::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;width:18px;height:10px;background:var(--ink);
  }
  .sheet::before{top:12px;left:12px}
  .sheet::after{top:12px;right:12px}
  .foot::before{bottom:12px;left:12px}
  .foot::after{bottom:12px;right:12px}

  header{background:var(--paper);padding-bottom:18px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--red)}
  h1{
    font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:900;margin:0;
    font-size:clamp(36px,7vw,68px);letter-spacing:.18em;line-height:1.15;text-align:center;
  }
  .meta{text-align:center;margin:6px 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:var(--graphite);letter-spacing:.06em}
  .meta span{display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;margin:0 .7em}
  .fields{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 28px;justify-content:center;font-size:15px}
  .field{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;color:var(--red)}
  .field span.line{
    display:inline-block;min-width:120px;border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--red);
    font-family:"Kaiti SC","STKaiti","KaiTi",var(--serif);
    color:var(--graphite);font-size:18px;text-align:center;height:1.6em;line-height:1.6em;
  }

  .notice{
    margin:22px 0;padding:14px 18px;border:1.5px solid var(--red);background:var(--paper);
    font-size:15px;max-width:44em;
  }
  .notice h2{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--red);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em}
  .notice ol{margin:0;padding-left:1.4em}
  .notice li{margin:2px 0}

  .answer{border:2px solid var(--red);padding:10px;background:var(--paper)}
  .answer .tab{
    font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:700;color:var(--red);font-size:14px;
    letter-spacing:.2em;margin:0 0 8px 2px;
  }
  .screen{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#000;overflow:hidden}
  video{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block;background:#000}

  .gate{
    position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;
    background:#000;color:#e9e3e1;transition:opacity .45s ease;
  }
  .gate.gone{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
  .bubble{
    appearance:none;border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer;color:inherit;
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font:inherit;font-size:clamp(16px,2.4vw,20px);letter-spacing:.12em;
    padding:10px 14px;
  }
  .bubble:disabled{cursor:progress;opacity:.55}
  .oval{
    width:clamp(58px,8vw,78px);height:clamp(28px,3.8vw,36px);border:2.5px solid var(--red);border-radius:50%;
    position:relative;overflow:hidden;flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;
    font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;color:var(--red);letter-spacing:0;
  }
  .oval::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--ink);border-radius:50%;
    transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left center;
  }
  .bubble:not(:disabled):hover .oval,.bubble:focus-visible .oval{background:rgba(200,50,58,.15)}
  .bubble:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--red);outline-offset:4px}
  .filled .oval::after{transform:scaleX(1);transition:transform .38s steps(7)}
  .filled .oval{border-color:#fff}
  .status{font-size:13px;color:#8f8886;letter-spacing:.08em;min-height:1.4em}

  .foot{margin:18px 0 8px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--red)}

  @media (max-width:560px){
    body{padding-left:8px;padding-right:8px}
    .fields{justify-content:flex-start}
    .field span.line{min-width:96px}
    .foot{font-size:12px;padding:0 20px}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .filled .oval::after{transition:none}
    .gate{transition:none}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="sheet">
  <header>
    <h1>衡水 · 一天</h1>
    <p class="meta"><span>高三年级第 1095 次模拟考试</span><span>考试时间：60 秒</span></p>
    <div class="fields">
      <div class="field">姓名 <span class="line" id="name"></span></div>
      <div class="field">班级 <span class="line">高三(1)班</span></div>
      <div class="field">距高考 <span class="line" id="days">365 天</span></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="notice" aria-labelledby="n-h">
    <h2 id="n-h">注意事项</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>请打开声音，建议佩戴耳机。</li>
      <li>含高频闪烁画面和突然的巨响，对光敏感者请慎看。</li>
      <li>作答时间 60 秒，结束后可以重考。</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="answer" aria-label="作答区">
    <p class="tab">作答区</p>
    <div class="screen">
      <video id="v" playsinline preload="auto"></video>
      <div class="gate" id="gate">
        <button class="bubble" id="start" disabled>
          <span class="oval" aria-hidden="true">开</span>
          <span id="label">涂黑此处，开始考试</span>
        </button>
        <p class="status" id="status" role="status">正在分发试卷……</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="foot">请在作答区域内作答，超出黑色矩形边框限定区域的答案无效</p>
</main>

<script id="payload" type="application/octet-stream">